{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52187","headline":"颂六十二首 十二 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建志诚心愚，高慕欣朋俦。\n相与立弘誓，舍俗慕闲丘。\n萧散人物外，晃朗免绸缪。\n寂寂求戒（一作「诚」）真，亹亹励心柔。\n警策修三业，激切澄四流。\n兴心愿弘誓，救溺运慈舟。\n嘉期归妙觉，善会湼盘修。\n存心八正道，立志三只休。\n（见同书卷七《奖导部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷六一之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}